WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Juri jumps forward into OD Shikusen.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.500
OD Shikusen connects with the grounded Ryu.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
The heavy-kick follow-up extends the juggle.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Raw Drive Rush starts as Juri lands.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Crouching heavy punch catches airborne Ryu.

6
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.500
OD Saihasho extends the juggle.

7
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Sakkai Fuhazan starts after the projectile.

8
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Level 1 finishes the extended dive route.
